OL,3,GNEWSAHow online mocking of antique
OL,4,Agates led to a Harry Potter TV
OL,5,Aopportunity
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat started with online criticism
OL,8,Fended with an unexpected call from the
OL,9,Fteam behind the new Harry Potter TV
OL,10,Fseries for an antiques dealer.
OL,12,FWhen Joel Paxton posted a video of a
OL,13,Fset of gates on social media, he
OL,14,Fattracted hundreds of comments from
OL,15,Fpeople who disliked them.
OL,17,FBut among the almost one million people
OL,18,Fwho watched the clip was a set
OL,19,Fdesigner, working on HBO's new Harry
OL,20,FPotter series.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
